  "title": {
    "raw": "Rainy weather persists through Monday before clearing this week",
    "rendered": "Rainy weather persists through Monday before clearing this week"
  },
  "content": {
    "raw": "<p>High rain chances are expected to continue across the region through Monday, according to weather officials. The forecast indicates that it will be dry Monday afternoon through Friday morning.</p> <p>Rain is expected to return over the weekend as conditions change. No significant storms or severe weather are currently anticipated, but residents are advised to stay updated on local forecasts.</p> <p>Officials recommend residents plan accordingly for continued wet conditions through the start of the week and prepare for possible rain over the weekend.</p>\n\n<p><em>Source: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/330424809127534/posts/1527427532760583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Original Article</a></em></p>",
    "rendered": "<p>High rain chances are expected to continue across the region through Monday, according to weather officials. The forecast indicates that it will be dry Monday afternoon through Friday morning.</p>\n<p>Rain is expected to return over the weekend as conditions change. No significant storms or severe weather are currently anticipated, but residents are advised to stay updated on local forecasts.</p>\n<p>Officials recommend residents plan accordingly for continued wet conditions through the start of the week and prepare for possible rain over the weekend.</p>\n<p><em>Source: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/330424809127534/posts/1527427532760583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Original Article</a></em></p>\n",
    "protected": false,
    "block_version": 0
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "raw": "Forecasters predict ongoing rain through Monday, with dry conditions expected Monday afternoon through Friday. Rain returns over the weekend.",
    "rendered": "<p>Forecasters predict ongoing rain through Monday, with dry conditions expected Monday afternoon through Friday. Rain returns over the weekend.</p>\n",
